{# Slot of course/_roster_row.html.twig (#10), inside the <tr>: the "Lessons left" cell (REG-5, E1/E3,
   D-047). S9 balance badge with its label ("Low", "Renewal needed", "n lessons outstanding"), the
   10-segment pass bar (desktop only, credits.css) and the "+10" soft pill to the grant page (PD7: only
   when the balance is at most 2, the enrollment active, the student not archived and the course open).
   The badge state tints the whole row through :has() (PD8, credits.css). One Balances query per roster
   (credits_course_balance() is memoised per course).
   Params (slot contract): course (array{id: string, name: string, timezone: string}); row (App\Courses\ReadModel\RosterRow).
   Call: {% include 'course/_roster_balance.html.twig' ignore missing with {course: course_slot, row: row} only %} #}
{% trans_default_domain 'credits' %}
{% set b = credits_course_balance(course.id, row.enrollmentId) %}
<td class="roster-balance" data-label="{{ 'credits.roster.column'|trans }}">
    {%- if b %}
        <span class="roster-balance__value">
            {% include 'components/_balance_badge.html.twig' with {balance: b.balance} only %}
            <span class="roster-balance__bar">{% include 'components/_pass_dots.html.twig' with {left: b.balance, variant: 'bar'} only %}</span>
        </span>
        {%- if b.balance <= 2 and b.active and not row.studentArchived and credits_course_open(course.id) %}
            {% include 'components/_link_button.html.twig' with {
                label: 'credits.roster.add_ten'|trans,
                href: path('credit_grant', {id: course.id, enrollmentId: row.enrollmentId.toRfc4122, from: 'course'}),
                variant: 'soft',
                size: 'pill-sm',
                attr: {class: 'roster-balance__add', 'aria-label': 'credits.roster.add_ten_label'|trans({name: row.firstName ~ ' ' ~ row.lastName})},
            } only %}
        {%- endif %}
    {%- endif -%}
</td>
